# Sales Data Analysis using Python

## 📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes the Global Superstore dataset using Python, Pandas, and Matplotlib to generate business insights through data analysis and visualization.

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- VS Code

## 📂 Dataset

- Global Superstore Dataset

## 📊 Analysis Performed

- Sales by Category
- Profit by Category
- Sales by Segment
- Profit by Region
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Monthly Profit Trend
- Top 10 Customers by Sales
- Top 10 Customers by Profit
- Top 10 Products by Sales
- Top 10 Products by Profit
- Average Sales by Category
- Sales by Ship Mode

## 📈 Charts

The project includes multiple charts saved in the **output/** folder.

## 💡 Key Business Insights

- Technology generated the highest sales and profit.
- Consumer is the highest revenue-generating customer segment.
- Adrian Barton is the top customer by sales.
- Motorola Smart Phone is the highest-selling product.
- December recorded the highest monthly profit.
- Standard Class is the most preferred shipping mode.

